            <div xml:id="d107">

                <pb facs="0109" n="100" sameAs="frus:frus1940v02/pg100"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">340.1115A/671b: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Switzerland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Harrison</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1940-05-21">May 21, 1940</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>55. After consulting offices in Switzerland please cable whether American
                    citizens are able to proceed promptly to Genoa from Switzerland for embarkation
                    United States. Is there any difficulty in obtaining Swiss exit visas or Italian
                    entrance and exit visas?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
